{# A book's availability as a badge (chapter 80), for the book's page. It gets copies, the number of
   copies on the shelf, and nothing else:
   - 0: "All copies on loan", level warn;
   - 1: "1 copy on the shelf", level ok;
   - more: "3 copies on the shelf", level ok.
   As <span class="badge LEVEL">TEXT</span>: the words are always there, never the colour alone. #}
{% if copies == 0 %}
<span class="badge warn">All copies on loan</span>
{% else %}
<span class="badge ok">{{ copies }} {{ copies == 1 ? 'copy' : 'copies' }} on the shelf</span>
{% endif %}
